<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has</p>
<p>completed all four credit auctions in the secondary market.</p>
<p>    CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM     MAX    MIN     AVERAGE</p>
<p>    1.245  bln pesos  15 days  25.40  25.43   25.26</p>
<p>    1.245  bln pesos  13 days  25.13  25.09   25.13</p>
<p>    1.245  bln pesos  12 days  25.15  25.14   25.15</p>
<p>    1.000  bln pesos   1 day   24.38  24.28   24.30</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
